# Generated project report
# The .docx is a build artifact of the screenshot and document pipeline, not
# source. It is ~18 MB and is regenerated whenever the report changes, so
# committing it would add that much to the repository's permanent history on
# every revision. Keep the file locally; version the code that produces it.
